girls,

00:25:50.770 --> 00:25:51.711
and the little...

00:25:52.191 --> 00:25:54.712
This functional kid standing around on the corner has none of that.

00:25:55.053 --> 00:25:58.434
The assumption was by many law enforcement officials,

00:25:58.494 --> 00:26:00.976
