00:26:09.921 --> 00:26:18.405
Our research across the nation suggests that maybe 8 to 10 percent of all the street gangs are of this specialty type,

00:26:18.505 --> 00:26:20.326
drug gangs or burglary gangs,

00:26:20.406 --> 00:26:21.006
robbery gangs,

00:26:21.127 --> 00:26:21.787
auto theft gangs.

00:26:22.451 --> 00:26:26.772
Gangs that concentrate on a particular form of criminal activity.

00:26:27.393 --> 00:26:28.713
Law enforcement in some cases,

00:26:28.813 --> 00:26:30.133
media in many cases,

00:26:30.573 --> 00:26:35.695
pick out the more dramatic examples of the drug-selling group and say,

00:26:35.855 --> 00:26:36.195
aha,

00:26:36.735 --> 00:26:38.096
this is what gangs have become.

00:26:39.156 --> 00:26:39.576
They're wrong.

00:26:40.737 --> 00:26:41.917
Some gangs have become that.

00:26:41.997 --> 00:26:43.597
The majority have not.

00:26:49.003 --> 00:26:50.483
Like Raymond Washington before him,

00:26:50.904 --> 00:26:53.024
Batman was in prison while the world changed.

00:26:53.724 --> 00:26:56.705
He emerged to find the crack explosion already in progress.

00:26:57.225 --> 00:27:00.086
That's when I was introduced to the cocaine.

