I'm just gonna kick it like that.

00:27:09.329 --> 00:27:09.729
He like,

00:27:10.129 --> 00:27:11.289
you running with the little homies,

00:27:11.969 --> 00:27:12.910
get them to rock it up,

00:27:12.950 --> 00:27:14.850
and they know what to do,

00:27:14.910 --> 00:27:15.430
they know what to do.

