00:27:30.522 --> 00:27:32.323
You been on the prison for about 20 years.

00:27:32.703 --> 00:27:33.123
All of a sudden,

00:27:33.143 --> 00:27:35.625
now y'all is into it because of the drugs.

00:27:36.165 --> 00:27:36.445
You know,

00:27:36.525 --> 00:27:38.726
now either he want to kill you or you want to kill him.

