Then once he gets there,

00:36:05.239 --> 00:36:06.420
sees that that new area,

00:36:06.460 --> 00:36:07.481
this virgin turf,

00:36:07.601 --> 00:36:08.362
the police,

00:36:08.422 --> 00:36:09.783
nobody knows about gangs.

00:36:09.843 --> 00:36:10.563
Then they set up,

00:36:10.984 --> 00:36:13.345
call some homies back here who go out and help them,

00:36:13.766 --> 00:36:17.068
and maybe set up a dope network around the surrounding little communities,

00:36:17.128 --> 00:36:18.029
like an octopus.

00:36:18.850 --> 00:36:21.952
And pretty soon there's a link between there and here.

00:36:22.132 --> 00:36:23.093
For several years,

00:36:23.273 --> 00:36:27.114
Sergeant McBride has charted where Crippen blood gangs have appeared across the U.S.

