00:36:34.496 --> 00:36:35.156
For McBride,

00:36:35.157 --> 00:36:40.198
it is enough that Raymond Washington's original group of 10 has become a national problem.

00:36:42.138 --> 00:36:43.299
By 1987,

00:36:43.499 --> 00:36:46.519
gang violence in Los Angeles had reached epidemic proportions,

00:36:46.559 --> 00:36:49.420
with homicides occurring at an average rate of more than one a day.

00:36:50.480 --> 00:36:52.061
In February of 1988,

00:36:52.062 --> 00:36:52.341
however,

00:36:52.945 --> 00:36:59.067
Raymond Washington's legacy would break out of his South Central birthplace and order television screens around the world.

00:37:00.787 --> 00:37:03.948
27-year-old Karen Toshima was celebrating a promotion in Westwood,

00:37:04.228 --> 00:37:06.629
a popular night spot near the UCLA campus.

00:37:07.369 --> 00:37:09.389
