00:37:34.880 --> 00:37:37.001
A city council person named Robert Farrell,

00:37:37.281 --> 00:37:37.602
who said,

00:37:37.622 --> 00:37:38.322
unfortunately,

00:37:38.342 --> 00:37:41.744
there is a perception that a life lost in South Los Angeles,

00:37:41.964 --> 00:37:42.624
in East L.A.,

00:37:43.145 --> 00:37:45.386
does not measure up to a life lost in Westwood.

00:37:46.226 --> 00:37:49.888
And that's the way a lot of the residents of South Los Angeles were feeling,

00:37:49.928 --> 00:37:50.609
because they saw...

00:37:51.197 --> 00:37:52.698
A heightened police presence.

00:37:52.958 --> 00:37:58.000
So as soon as a prominent or mainstream person is affected by gang activities,

00:37:58.620 --> 00:37:59.941
then the rest of us react.

00:38:01.240 --> 00:38:05.182
The end result was a renewed effort by law enforcement to suppress gang activity.

00:38:05.883 --> 00:38:10.005
Chief Daryl Gates received additional funding and manpower for his CRASH program,

00:38:10.785 --> 00:38:13.286
Community Resources Against Street Hoodlums.

00:38:14.367 --> 00:38:19.809
There was a time when the Los Angeles Police Department was listening to the outcomes of our research.

00:38:20.365 --> 00:38:24.407
And Darryl Gates put out an order to all stations in the LAPD,

00:38:24.607 --> 00:38:26.148
that was Chief Gates at that time,

00:38:27.529 --> 00:38:35.894
that in the handling of gangs they should be very careful not to do anything that would bring status or identity to the gangs because this would increase their strength.

00:38:37.694 --> 00:38:40.796
When the gangs became notably worse during the

00:38:41.457 --> 00:38:42.797
1980s, when they became more numerous,

00:38:42.877 --> 00:38:43.578
more violent,

00:38:44.158 --> 00:38:44.578
LAPD,

00:38:44.738 --> 00:38:46.439
along with a lot of other police departments,

00:38:47.120 --> 00:38:49.321
forgot that message and simply turned to...

00:38:49.761 --> 00:38:50.501
crackdowns,

00:38:50.622 --> 00:38:52.943
doing more of what they already knew how to do.

00:38:53.303 --> 00:38:55.304
I ain't going to just shoot the whole police force down,

00:38:55.305 --> 00:38:56.305
because you got good police,

00:38:56.306 --> 00:38:57.225
you got bad police.

00:38:57.745 --> 00:38:58.726
But if I'm a crip,

