we got a crip.

00:39:03.609 --> 00:39:04.589
Same thing they do with them.

00:39:04.609 --> 00:39:07.071
They drop them off in a crip neighborhood and holler out,

00:39:07.311 --> 00:39:08.051
we got a Blood.

00:39:08.611 --> 00:39:09.152
It's sad,

00:39:09.172 --> 00:39:14.355
because why would you bring somebody in somebody else's community knowing that this was going to happen?

00:39:14.895 --> 00:39:18.317
LAPD operated at one point something called Operation Hammer.

00:39:18.601 --> 00:39:20.262
Which they feel badly about now,

00:39:20.282 --> 00:39:23.423
but at the time it was a very big thing.

00:39:23.425 --> 00:39:30.968
A thousand officers sweep into south central Los Angeles to pick up as many gang members on a Friday and a Saturday night as they could possibly do.

00:39:32.989 --> 00:39:33.528
A war,

00:39:33.749 --> 00:39:34.829
if we're going to fight a war,

00:39:35.050 --> 00:39:38.271
must be sustained until you achieve your objective.

00:39:38.292 --> 00:39:43.855
Our objective is to get rid of the little terrorists that are creating havoc on our streets.

00:39:44.215 --> 00:39:44.655
We think,

00:39:44.835 --> 00:39:46.036
because of the show of force,

00:39:46.076 --> 00:39:47.917
that crime generally will go down.

00:39:48.529 --> 00:39:49.810
Those backfired essentially.

00:39:49.970 --> 00:39:51.972
They didn't get many legitimate arrests,

00:39:51.973 --> 00:39:54.053
they didn't get many felony convictions out of those,

00:39:54.294 --> 00:39:56.015
but they sure angered an awful lot of people.

00:39:56.475 --> 00:40:01.219
And they alienated gang members even further than they were alienated against the LAPD to begin with.

00:40:01.619 --> 00:40:03.081
At the end of 1988,

00:40:03.082 --> 00:40:04.582
homicides were at an all-time high,

00:40:04.902 --> 00:40:06.944
and then it went up again in 1989,

00:40:06.945 --> 00:40:07.624
the following year.

00:40:08.225 --> 00:40:12.548
So the efforts to police gangs and police crimes were a big failure.

00:40:14.945 --> 00:40:24.170
The perceived enmity between the LAPD and the residents of South Central came to a head when a Simi Valley jury acquitted the police officers charged in the battery of Rodney King.

