So when the Rodney King event took place,

00:40:41.520 --> 00:40:42.861
it triggered off again this...

00:40:43.101 --> 00:40:50.526
this remaining residual anti-police feeling in the community and anti-authority feeling in the community.

00:40:57.791 --> 00:40:59.072
By the mid-1990s,

00:40:59.192 --> 00:41:03.875
the Department of Justice estimated that there were over 600,000 gang members nationwide.

