00:41:10.480 --> 00:41:11.481
The message today...

00:41:12.197 --> 00:41:12.837
To the Bloods,

00:41:12.838 --> 00:41:13.417
the Crips,

00:41:14.018 --> 00:41:17.398
to every criminal gang preying on the innocent is clear.

