to break the backs of your organization,

00:41:23.180 --> 00:41:26.141
to stop you from terrorizing our neighborhoods and our children,

00:41:26.961 --> 00:41:29.142
to put you away for a very long time.

00:41:30.082 --> 00:41:31.662
We have just begun the job,

00:41:32.382 --> 00:41:35.783
and we do not intend to stop until we have finished.

00:41:37.184 --> 00:41:41.405
The violence of L.A.'s unrest helped trigger a new wave of federal resources and support.

00:41:42.473 --> 00:41:45.935
Using conspiracy statutes originally designed to combat the Mafia,

00:41:46.336 --> 00:41:52.080
the FBI formed a special task force to combat street gangs that had reached the next level of criminal enterprise.

00:41:52.660 --> 00:41:56.703
One of their first targets was a drug trafficking clique within the Grape Street Crips.

00:41:58.644 --> 00:42:00.325
Wayne Day was probably the largest.

00:42:00.666 --> 00:42:01.586
Somewhere along the line,

00:42:01.587 --> 00:42:04.168
he was dubbed as the godfather of Watts.

00:42:04.668 --> 00:42:08.311
It is believed Day expanded his operations across state lines when the L.A.

00:42:08.391 --> 00:42:11.173
market for crack became saturated and prices fell.

00:42:12.189 --> 00:42:17.211
He regularly enlisted younger gang members to ferry narcotics across the country on his behalf.

00:42:17.611 --> 00:42:18.312
At the time,

00:42:18.532 --> 00:42:22.173
a kilogram of cocaine was selling for $14,000 in Los Angeles,

00:42:22.814 --> 00:42:28.336
but could be sold for $23,000 to $24,000 in Minneapolis or Chicago or Cleveland.

00:42:28.776 --> 00:42:29.356
In the end,

00:42:29.436 --> 00:42:33.558
the Grape Street investigation yielded over 100 indictments nationwide,

00:42:33.838 --> 00:42:36.059
with 20 convictions in Los Angeles alone.

00:42:37.260 --> 00:42:40.141
And while the seizures of currency and narcotics were significant,

00:42:40.481 --> 00:42:43.822
More revealing was the fact that when gang members were threatened with prison,

00:42:44.222 --> 00:42:46.123
